{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The random title draw selected **Star Reclaimers**. The campaign will follow a patrol from a raided starbase through two hostile sectors to a command ship, with energy management, target tracking, damage, and docking along the way.\n\nI’m using the local **game-toolchain** skill for the procedural assets. Multiplayer will use AI Hub’s ghost mode, plus a standalone two-player patrol race through peer-to-peer link codes.\n"}}
