{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'forceWebGL|async init|MeshToon|outputColorSpace|setAnimationLoop' node_modules/three/src/renderers/common/Renderer.js node_modules/three/src/renderers/webgpu/WebGPURenderer.js node_modules/three/src/materials/nodes/MeshToonNodeMaterial.js node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/package.json node_modules/three/package.json\"","aggregated_output":"node_modules/three/src/materials/nodes/MeshToonNodeMaterial.js:4:import { MeshToonMaterial } from '../MeshToonMaterial.js';\nnode_modules/three/src/materials/nodes/MeshToonNodeMaterial.js:6:const _defaultValues = /*@__PURE__*/ new MeshToonMaterial();\nnode_modules/three/src/materials/nodes/MeshToonNodeMaterial.js:9: * Node material version of {@link MeshToonMaterial}.\nnode_modules/three/src/materials/nodes/MeshToonNodeMaterial.js:13:class MeshToonNodeMaterial extends NodeMaterial {\nnode_modules/three/src/materials/nodes/MeshToonNodeMaterial.js:17:\t\treturn 'MeshToonNodeMaterial';\nnode_modules/three/src/materials/nodes/MeshToonNodeMaterial.js:37:\t\tthis.isMeshToonNodeMaterial = true;\nnode_modules/three/src/materials/nodes/MeshToonNodeMaterial.js:66:export default MeshToonNodeMaterial;\nnode_modules/three/src/renderers/webgpu/WebGPURenderer.js:39:\t * @property {boolean} [forceWebGL=false] - If set to `true`, the renderer uses a WebGL 2 backend no matter if WebGPU is supported or not.\nnode_modules/three/src/renderers/webgpu/WebGPURenderer.js:55:\t\tif ( parameters.forceWebGL ) {\nnode_modules/three/src/renderers/common/Renderer.js:181:\t\tthis.outputColorSpace = SRGBColorSpace;\nnode_modules/three/src/renderers/common/Renderer.js:739:\tasync init() {\nnode_modules/three/src/renderers/common/Renderer.js:1620:\tasync setAnimationLoop( callback ) {\nnode_modules/three/src/renderers/common/Renderer.js:1624:\t\tthis._animation.setAnimationLoop( callback );\nnode_modules/three/src/renderers/common/Renderer.js:2169:\t\treturn this.isOutputTarget ? this.outputColorSpace : ColorManagement.workingColorSpace;\nnode_modules/three/src/renderers/common/Renderer.js:2215:\t\tthis.setAnimationLoop( null );\nnode_modules/three/src/renderers/common/Renderer.js:2505:\tasync initTextureAsync( texture ) {\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > design.md <<'EOF'\n# Star Reclaimers\n\nAn original cockpit space-combat / tactical patrol game inspired by Star Raiders (1982). First-person flight with an optional chase camera. A complete six-sector operation: defend Kestrel, clear Ember and Picket, strip two shield relays from the Crown command ship, destroy its core, then return to dock. Optional salvage, a second repair station, asteroid hazards, energy allocation, target computer, nova charges, shield, hyperspace, subsystem damage, campaign debrief and persistent best score.\n\nArt: ink outlines, hard cel bands, rust-red planet, ivory/yellow instrument lettering and turquoise exhaust against a violet void. All geometry, textures, effects, synthesis and voices created in code. Native Three AnimationMixer clips drive ship parts, station rings, recoil and explosion expansion. Rapier integrates the ship, projectiles and collision queries.\n\nController first: left stick thrust/strafe; right stick steer; R2 fire; L2 boost; Cross shields; Circle nova; Square dock/salvage; Triangle target; L1 chart; R1 jump; R3 camera; Options pause. Keyboard/mouse: mouse steer; WASD thrust/strafe; Space/click fire; Shift boost; C shields; X nova; F dock; T target; M chart; J jump; V camera; Escape pause. Adaptive prompts and Xbox option. Touch: two invisible sticks, assisted fire/target/shield, contact-sensitive action.\n\nAI Hub ghost sessions 1–4, with seeded independent operations and visible wingmate holograms in matching sectors. Standalone two-pilot peer-to-peer patrol race through manually exchanged WebRTC link codes, and a same-browser link for easy local testing. No chat or custom names. Pause offers live tuning and testing tools. Ten-second title idle starts a looping autopilot exhibition; any input returns to title.\n\nDeliver one root HTML with bundled engines, embedded Rapier WASM, unmodified AI Hub session client, all UI and code. Keep dev source and repeatable headless verification here. No internet research; only supplied AI Hub implementation contract and downloaded dependency source.\nEOF\nrg -n 'castRay\\\\(|castRayAndGetNormal\\\\(' node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/pipeline/world.d.ts node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/pipeline/query_pipeline.d.ts\nhead -30 hub-session.js\nrg -n 'script.*src|from .*(bridge|round)' hub-harness.html\ncat node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/package.json\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > design.md <<'EOF'\n# Star Reclaimers\n\nAn original cockpit space-combat / tactical patrol game inspired by Star Raiders (1982). First-person flight with an optional chase camera. A complete six-sector operation: defend Kestrel, clear Ember and Picket, strip two shield relays from the Crown command ship, destroy its core, then return to dock. Optional salvage, a second repair station, asteroid hazards, energy allocation, target computer, nova charges, shield, hyperspace, subsystem damage, campaign debrief and persistent best score.\n\nArt: ink outlines, hard cel bands, rust-red planet, ivory/yellow instrument lettering and turquoise exhaust against a violet void. All geometry, textures, effects, synthesis and voices created in code. Native Three AnimationMixer clips drive ship parts, station rings, recoil and explosion expansion. Rapier integrates the ship, projectiles and collision queries.\n\nController first: left stick thrust/strafe; right stick steer; R2 fire; L2 boost; Cross shields; Circle nova; Square dock/salvage; Triangle target; L1 chart; R1 jump; R3 camera; Options pause. Keyboard/mouse: mouse steer; WASD thrust/strafe; Space/click fire; Shift boost; C shields; X nova; F dock; T target; M chart; J jump; V camera; Escape pause. Adaptive prompts and Xbox option. Touch: two invisible sticks, assisted fire/target/shield, contact-sensitive action.\n\nAI Hub ghost sessions 1–4, with seeded independent operations and visible wingmate holograms in matching sectors. Standalone two-pilot peer-to-peer patrol race through manually exchanged WebRTC link codes, and a same-browser link for easy local testing. No chat or custom names. Pause offers live tuning and testing tools. Ten-second title idle starts a looping autopilot exhibition; any input returns to title.\n\nDeliver one root HTML with bundled engines, embedded Rapier WASM, unmodified AI Hub session client, all UI and code. Keep dev source and repeatable headless verification here. No internet research; only supplied AI Hub implementation contract and downloaded dependency source.\nEOF\nrg -n 'castRay\\\\(|castRayAndGetNormal\\\\(' node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/pipeline/world.d.ts node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/pipeline/query_pipeline.d.ts\nhead -30 hub-session.js\nrg -n 'script.*src|from .*(bridge|round)' hub-harness.html\ncat node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/package.json\"","aggregated_output":"node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/pipeline/world.d.ts:330:    castRay(ray: Ray, maxToi: number, solid: boolean, filterFlags?: QueryFilterFlags, filterGroups?: InteractionGroups, filterExcludeCollider?: Collider, filterExcludeRigidBody?: RigidBody, filterPred [... omitted end of long line]\nnode_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/pipeline/world.d.ts:343:    castRayAndGetNormal(ray: Ray, maxToi: number, solid: boolean, filterFlags?: QueryFilterFlags, filterGroups?: InteractionGroups, filterExcludeCollider?: Collider, filterExcludeRigidBody?: RigidBody [... omitted end of long line]\n/*! aihub-session 1.4.0 — AI Hub Session Protocol v1 client. Paste it into your game unmodified. */\n(function (root) {\n  'use strict';\n  if (root.AIHub) return;\n\n  var VERSION = '1.4.0';\n  var HELLO_EVERY_MS = 500;\n  var HELLO_TIMEOUT_MS = 10000;\n  var PROGRESS_EVERY_MS = 1000;\n  /** The hub's welcome may change these; a newer hub never needs a newer copy of this file for it. */\n  var limits = { maxBytes: 16384, ratePerS: 20, burst: 40 };\n\n  var framed = false;\n  try {\n    framed = root.parent && root.parent !== root;\n  } catch (e) {\n    framed = true;\n  }\n  var search = String(root.location && root.location.search);\n  var flagged = /[?&]aihub=/.test(search);\n  var seedArg = /[?&]aihub-seed=(\\d+)/.exec(search);\n\n  var hub = {\n    version: VERSION,\n    protocol: 1,\n    /** True when the hub launched this page for a session (?aihub=1 inside a frame). */\n    active: !!(flagged && framed),\n    me: null,\n    host: null,\n    isHost: false,\n66:import { createBridge, attachFrame, postTo, createLocalNetwork } from './bridge.js';\n67:import { createRound, limitFor, modeOf, seedsRandom, SELF_REPORTED, TIMINGS } from './round.js';\n{\n  \"name\": \"@dimforge/rapier3d-compat\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"collaborators\": [\n    \"Sébastien Crozet <developer@crozet.re>\"\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"3-dimensional physics engine in Rust - official JS bindings. Compatibility package with inlined webassembly as base64.\",\n  \"version\": \"0.19.3\",\n  \"license\": \"Apache-2.0\",\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"type\": \"git\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/dimforge/rapier.js\"\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"*\"\n  ],\n  \"main\": \"rapier.cjs\",\n  \"homepage\": \"https://rapier.rs\",\n  \"types\": \"rapier.d.ts\",\n  \"sideEffects\": [\n    \"./snippets/*\"\n  ],\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"physics\",\n    \"dynamics\",\n    \"rigid\",\n    \"real-time\",\n    \"joints\"\n  ],\n  \"module\": \"rapier.mjs\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": {\n      \"types\": \"./rapier.d.ts\",\n      \"require\": \"./rapier.cjs\",\n      \"import\": \"./rapier.mjs\"\n    }\n  }\n}","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > shell.html <<'EOF'\n<\"'!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<script>{{HUB_CLIENT}}</script>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#111525\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"ghost\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Save Kestrel, destroy the Crown, return with the best score\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Sticks fly; R2 fire; L1 chart; R1 jump. Mouse aim, WASD fly, M chart, J jump.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"12\">\n<title>Star Reclaimers — a deep-space patrol</title>\n<style>\n@font-face{font-family:Display;src:local('\"'Impact')}*{box-sizing:border-box} :root{--ink:#101421;--paper:#f5f0d7;--muted:#a7b4be;--yellow:#ffdf78;--cyan:#8bdaca;--red:#f08068;--panel:rgba(16,23,37,.92)}html,body{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(14px,1.28vw,25px)}button,input,textarea{font:inherit}button{color:inherit;cursor:pointer;touch-action:manipulation}button:disabled{opacity:.38;cursor:default}button,textarea,input{outline:none}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,.focused{outline:3px solid var(--yellow)\"'!important;outline-offset:5px!important}button:hover{filter:brightness(1.13)}button:active{transform:translateY(2px)}button{transition:background .15s,transform .15s}canvas#world{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}#ink-wash{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 35%,transparent 25%,rgba(9,15,27,.28) 75%),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(14,18,31,.5),transparent 65%);mix-blend-mode:multiply}#grain{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.075;background-image:url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='\"'0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.68' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Cpath fill='%23fff' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='.7' d='M0 0h180v180H0z'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\\\")} .hide{display:none\"'!important}.mono,.eyebrow,.pill,.glyph,.stat-label,.map-meta,.hud-label{font-family:'\"'Courier New',monospace;font-weight:700}.eyebrow{font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cyan)}.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.55em;border:1px solid #75818d;border-radius:2px;padding:.45em .8em;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.12em}.pill i{width:.5em;height:.5em;background:var(--cyan);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--cyan)}#title-screen{position:fixed;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:3.2vh 4.2vw 2.8vh} .topline{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand-mark{display:flex;gap:.7em;align-items:center;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em}.brand-mark svg{width:2.6em;height:2.6em}.edition{color:var(--muted);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.13em}.title-body{margin-top:-1vh;width:52%;max-width:1000px}.title-body h1{font-family:Display,'Arial Black',Arial,sans-serif;font-stretch:condensed;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(66px,9.5vw,185px);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.028em;margin:3vh 0 2vh;text-transform:uppercase;text-shadow:5px 5px 0 #0c1524;transform:skewY(-3deg);transform-origin:left}.title-body h1 span{display:block;color:var(--yellow);font-size:.88em}.title-kicker{font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:.07em;margin:3.2vh 0 2vh;color:var(--paper)}.intro-copy{max-width:25em;font-size:.85rem;color:#c0c9cb;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:3vh}.title-buttons{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.4vh;width:22em;max-width:94%}.menu-primary,.menu-secondary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:.85em 1em;border:2px solid var(--paper);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.025em;min-height:3.2em;text-align:left}.menu-primary{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--yellow);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--ink)}.menu-primary .sub{font-size:.64em;font-weight:600;opacity:.75}.menu-secondary{background:rgba(17,24,40,.65);border-color:#677582}.menu-secondary .sub{font-size:.6em;color:var(--muted)}.title-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.66rem;color:var(--muted)}.link-group{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.2em}.text-button{background:none;border:0;padding:.5em 0;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--paper)}.title-side{position:absolute;right:4.2vw;bottom:17vh;max-width:21em;border-left:2px solid var(--yellow);padding-left:1em}.title-side p{font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.5;color:#c1cbd0}.side-number{font-family:Display,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:2.4rem;letter-spacing:.06em}.coordinate{position:absolute;right:4.2vw;top:20vh;text-align:right;font-size:.65rem;color:var(--cyan);line-height:1.8}.tiny{font-size:.6rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}.glyph{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-width:1.6em;height:1.6em;padding:0 .25em;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:3px;font-size:.74em;margin-right:.4em;line-height:1}.glyph.circle{border-radius:50%}.right-arrow{font-size:1.4em}.tag{color:var(--cyan)}#loading{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#111827;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:20;gap:1.5rem}#loading strong{font-family:Display,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:3rem;letter-spacing:.08em}#loading-bar{width:18em;height:4px;background:#35414f;overflow:hidden}#loading-bar i{display:block;width:20%;height:100%;background:var(--yellow);animation:load 1.3s ease-in-out infinite}@keyframes load{50%{transform:translateX(400%)}}#loading p{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:30em;text-align:center;line-height:1.5}.screen-frame{position:fixed;inset:2.6vh 2.8vw;pointer-events:none;border:1px solid #71808722;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% 94%,97% 100%,0 100%)}#hud{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;text-shadow:0 2px 3px var(--ink)}#hud-canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}.hud-top{position:absolute;top:3.5vh;left:3.5vw;right:3.5vw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start}.sector-block .hud-label{font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--cyan)}.sector-block h2{font-size:1.5rem;letter-spacing:.04em;margin:.18em 0}.sector-block small{font-size:.63rem;color:var(--muted)}.heading-tape{padding:.6em 2em;border-top:1px solid #a7c9c266;color:var(--cyan);font-size:.67rem;letter-spacing:.24em}.score-block{text-align:right}.score-block strong{font-family:Display,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:2.2rem;letter-spacing:.07em}.score-block small{display:block;font-size:.6rem;color:var(--yellow);letter-spacing:.13em}.objective{position:absolute;top:17vh;left:3.5vw;max-width:21em;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.45}.objective small{display:block;color:var(--yellow);font-size:.59rem;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-bottom:.45em}.objective b{font-weight:500}.comms{position:absolute;left:3.5vw;bottom:32vh;max-width:23em;padding:.85em 1em;border-left:3px solid var(--cyan);background:linear-gradient(90deg,#111c2aee,#111c2a88);font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.5}.comms .eyebrow{font-size:.52rem;margin-bottom:.5em}.comms p{margin:0}.cockpit-data{position:absolute;bottom:8.5vh;left:3.7vw;right:3.7vw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end}.radar-wrap{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:1em}.radar{width:8em;height:8em;border:1px solid #8bdaca66;border-radius:50%;background:#111d2a99;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.radar:before,.radar:after{content:'';position:absolute;background:#8bdaca33}.radar:before{width:1px;height:100%;left:50%}.radar:after{height:1px;width:100%;top:50%}.radar-ring{position:absolute;inset:20%;border:1px solid #8bdaca44;border-radius:50%}.radar-dot{position:absolute;width:5px;height:5px;background:var(--red);transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border-radius:1px}.radar-dot.friend{background:var(--cyan);border-radius:50%}.radar-dot.selected{background:var(--yellow);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--yellow)}.radar-label{font-size:.54rem;letter-spacing:.13em;text-align:center;margin-top:.5em;color:var(--cyan)}.speed-display strong{font-family:Display,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:2.4rem}.speed-display span{display:block;font-size:.54rem;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.1em}.gauges{display:flex;gap:1.5em;padding:.9em 1.3em;background:#111b2bd9;border-top:2px solid #8a9d9d77;clip-path:polygon(3% 0,97% 0,100% 100%,0 100%)}.gauge{width:5.5em}.gauge .stat-label{font-size:.54rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.gauge strong{font-family:Display,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:1.6rem;letter-spacing:.05em}.meter{height:4px;background:#42515a;margin-top:.3em}.meter i{height:100%;display:block;width:100%;background:var(--cyan);transition:width .12s}.gauge.energy .meter i{background:var(--yellow)}.gauge.hull .meter i{background:var(--red)}.target-readout{width:13.5em;border-right:3px solid var(--yellow);padding:.7em 1em;background:#111b2bbd}.target-readout small{font-size:.53rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--yellow)}.target-readout strong{display:block;font-size:.87rem;margin:.5em 0}.target-detail{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:.58rem}.actions{position:absolute;bottom:2.8vh;left:3.6vw;right:3.6vw;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:1.7em;color:#d2d8cb;font-size:.63rem}.context-action{position:absolute;left:50%;top:64%;transform:translateX(-50%);pointer-events:auto;background:var(--yellow);color:var(--ink);border:0;padding:.8em 1.2em;font-weight:800;box-shadow:4px 4px var(--ink);font-size:.8rem}#reticle{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:40px;height:40px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);color:var(--yellow)}#reticle:before,#reticle:after{content:'';position:absolute;background:currentColor}#reticle:before{left:50%;top:38%;width:2px;height:25%}#reticle:after{left:38%;top:50%;height:2px;width:25%}#reticle i{display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;border:1px solid #f6e4a688;clip-path:polygon(0 0,30% 0,30% 10%,10% 10%,10% 30%,0 30%,0 0,100% 0,100% 30%,90% 30%,90% 10%,70% 10%,70% 0,100% 0,100% 100%,70% 100%,70% 90%,90% 90%,90% 70%,100% 70%,100% 100%,0 100%,0 70%,10% 70%,10% 90%,30% 90%,30% 100%,0 100%)}.damage-flash{position:fixed;inset:0;box-shadow:inset 0 0 18vw #e7505580;pointer-events:none;opacity:0}.jump-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,transparent 10%,#78cecb99);mix-blend-mode:screen;pointer-events:none;opacity:0}.jump-text{position:fixed;top:37%;width:100%;text-align:center;pointer-events:none;text-transform:uppercase}.jump-text strong{font-family:Display,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:3.8rem;letter-spacing:.13em;display:block}.jump-text small{font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.28em}.attract-banner{position:fixed;bottom:2.5vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);text-align:center;background:var(--yellow);color:var(--ink);padding:.8em 2em;z-index:5;box-shadow:4px 4px var(--ink)}.attract-banner strong{font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.15em}.attract-banner small{display:block;font-size:.56rem;margin-top:.5em;letter-spacing:.15em}#modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(8,13,24,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);z-index:8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:4vh 5vw}.modal-card{width:100%;max-width:68em;max-height:91vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;border-top:3px solid var(--yellow);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1b2635f7,#101827f5);box-shadow:0 25px 80px #0008;padding:2em 2.4em;position:relative}.modal-card.narrow{max-width:30em}.modal-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:1em;margin-bottom:1.3em}.modal-head h2{font-family:Display,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:2.8rem;line-height:1;letter-spacing:.05em;margin:.15em 0 .2em;text-transform:uppercase}.modal-head p{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin:.5em 0 0;line-height:1.5}.close-button{border:1px solid #71868d;background:none;width:2.7em;height:2.7em;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none}.modal-body{overflow:auto;padding:.3em .35em .5em;scrollbar-color:#768c91 transparent;scrollbar-width:thin}.modal-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1em;margin-top:1.5em;padding-top:1em;border-top:1px solid #5c728644;font-size:.64rem;color:var(--muted)}.button-stack{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.7em}.control-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1em 2em}.control-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1em;font-size:.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #627b8633;padding:.8em .2em}.control-row b{color:var(--yellow);font-weight:500}.instruction-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.2em;margin-top:1.5em}.instruction-card{border-top:1px solid #8bdaca88;padding:1em 0}.instruction-card strong{color:var(--cyan);font-size:.82rem}.instruction-card p{font-size:.73rem;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted)}.chart-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1em}.sector-card{text-align:left;border:1px solid #657f8b77;background:#202d3b;position:relative;padding:1.1em;min-height:8.1em;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.55em}.sector-card.selected{background:#334247;border:2px solid var(--yellow);padding:calc(1.1em - 1px)}.sector-card .sector-id{color:var(--muted);font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.12em}.sector-card strong{font-size:1.05rem;letter-spacing:.025em}.sector-card .sector-type{font-size:.64rem;color:var(--cyan)}.sector-card .sector-status{font-size:.63rem;margin-top:auto;color:var(--yellow)}.sector-card .sector-symbol{position:absolute;right:1em;top:1em;color:var(--red);font-size:1.2rem}.chart-status{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:.76rem;margin:1em 0;color:var(--muted)}.chart-status strong{color:var(--yellow)}.options-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1em 2.5em}.setting{padding:.5em 0 .8em;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.65em}.setting label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.8rem}.setting label span{color:var(--cyan);font-family:'Courier New',monospace}.setting small{font-size:.62rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}.setting input{width:100%;accent-color:var(--yellow);height:1.1em}.toggle{border:1px solid #778d98;background:#253241;padding:.75em;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.toggle b{color:var(--yellow)}.dev-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:2.5em}.dev-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.7em;align-content:start}.small-button{background:#27394a;border:1px solid #758c97;padding:.9em .8em;text-align:left;font-weight:700;font-size:.72rem;min-height:3.4em}.dev-info{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:.62rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;border-top:1px solid #627b8655;margin-top:1em;padding-top:1em}.debrief-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1.1em;margin:1em 0 1.5em}.debrief-stat{padding:1em;background:#ffffff06;border-bottom:1px solid #8bdaca66}.debrief-stat small{font-size:.6rem;color:var(--muted);display:block}.debrief-stat strong{font-family:Display,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:2.6rem;letter-spacing:.05em}.debrief-copy{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.7;max-width:42em;color:#cbd4d1}.tabs{display:flex;gap:1.1em;margin:0 0 1.1em;flex-wrap:wrap}.tabs button{border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;padding:.6em .3em;background:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:.75rem}.tabs button.active{border-color:var(--yellow);color:var(--yellow)}.credits-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:9em 1fr;gap:.75em 1.5em;font-size:.73rem;line-height:1.55}.credits-grid b{color:var(--cyan);font-weight:500}.feedback{font-size:.77rem;line-height:1.6}.feedback p{border-bottom:1px solid #61788044;padding:.7em 0}.feedback strong{display:block;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:.3em}.net-columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2em}.net-panel{padding:1.2em;border:1px solid #73889366;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.8em}.net-panel h3{margin:0;color:var(--cyan);font-size:1rem}.net-panel p{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin:0}.codebox{width:100%;background:#101824;border:1px solid #6f838e;padding:.7em;color:var(--paper);resize:vertical;min-height:4.2em;font: .64rem 'Courier New',monospace;line-height:1.4}.net-status{color:var(--yellow);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.5;padding:.8em 0}.wingmate{position:absolute;right:3.5vw;top:26vh;background:#111d2ac9;border-right:2px solid var(--cyan);padding:.8em 1em;font-size:.64rem;line-height:1.7;text-align:right}.wingmate strong{color:var(--cyan);display:block}.touch-menu{position:fixed;top:1.2em;right:1.2em;z-index:6;background:#172438cc;border:1px solid #a4c9c5;color:var(--paper);padding:.6em;pointer-events:auto;display:none}.touch-action{display:none}.touch-hint{position:fixed;bottom:15vh;left:0;right:0;pointer-events:none;font-size:.6rem;color:#b7d6d066;display:none;justify-content:space-around}.notice{position:fixed;top:22vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:.7em 1.2em;background:#122335e8;border-bottom:2px solid var(--yellow);color:var(--yellow);font-size:.75rem;z-index:9;pointer-events:none;text-align:center;max-width:80vw}.touch .touch-menu,.touch .touch-action{display:block}.touch .touch-hint{display:flex}.touch #title-screen{padding:3vh 5vw}.touch .title-body{width:70%}.touch .title-side,.touch .coordinate{display:none}.touch .title-body h1{font-size:clamp(62px,12vw,150px)}.touch .title-kicker,.touch .intro-copy{max-width:28em}.touch .actions,.touch .comms,.touch .radar-wrap,.touch .target-readout,.touch .heading-tape{display:none}.touch .gauges{position:fixed;top:3.5vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:.4em .8em;gap:1em;font-size:.8em}.touch .gauge{width:4em}.touch .gauge strong{font-size:1.2rem}.touch .sector-block h2{font-size:1rem}.touch .sector-block small,.touch .score-block{display:none}.touch .objective{top:12vh;font-size:.66rem;max-width:19em}.touch .objective small{font-size:.48rem}.touch .touch-action{position:fixed;bottom:2em;background:#142637d9;border:1px solid #b1c7bd;color:var(--paper);padding:.7em 1em;font-size:.72rem;pointer-events:auto}.touch #touch-chart{left:1.4em}.touch #touch-nova{right:1.4em}.touch .modal-card{padding:1.2em;max-height:94vh}.touch .modal-head h2{font-size:2rem}.touch .modal-head p{font-size:.68rem}.touch .modal-footer{margin-top:.8em}.touch .title-foot{font-size:.6rem}.touch .link-group{gap:1.2em}@media(max-width:900px){.title-side{max-width:15em;font-size:.9em;bottom:16vh}.intro-copy{font-size:.8rem}.actions{gap:1em;font-size:.56rem}.gauges{gap:.8em}.gauge{width:4.3em}.target-readout{width:11em}.comms{max-width:19em;font-size:.66rem}.instruction-cards{gap:1em}.modal-card{padding:1.4em}.dev-grid{gap:1.4em}.title-foot .mono{max-width:25em}.heading-tape{display:none}.title-body h1{font-size:clamp(60px,9.2vw,140px)}}@media(max-width:600px){.title-body{width:100%\"'!important}.title-buttons{width:22em}.title-body h1{font-size:17vw!important}.title-side,.coordinate,.edition{display:none}.intro-copy{font-size:.75rem}.title-foot .mono{display:none}.chart-grid{gap:.6em}.sector-card{padding:.75em;min-height:7.5em}.sector-card strong{font-size:.87rem}.sector-card .sector-symbol{display:none}.sector-card.selected{padding:calc(.75em - 1px)}.control-grid,.options-grid,.dev-grid,.net-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.instruction-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}.instruction-card{padding:.7em 0}.debrief-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.credits-grid{grid-template-columns:6.5em 1fr}.modal-head h2{font-size:2.2rem}.gauges{gap:.7em}.gauge{width:3.6em}.target-readout{display:none}.radar{width:6em;height:6em}.actions{font-size:.5rem;gap:.7em;flex-wrap:wrap}.objective{font-size:.7rem;max-width:20em}.comms{bottom:31vh}.hud-top{top:3vh}.score-block strong{font-size:1.5rem}.gauge strong{font-size:1.25rem}.modal-footer{flex-wrap:wrap}.title-kicker{font-size:.67rem}.touch .gauges{left:auto;right:4vw;transform:none}.touch-menu{top:auto;bottom:6.5em;right:1.3em}.touch .objective{top:13vh}.touch .title-body{margin-top:0}.touch .title-buttons{max-width:98%}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button{transition:none}#grain{opacity:.035}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"world\" aria-label=\"Star Reclaimers 3D space flight\"></canvas><div id=\"ink-wash\"></div><div id=\"grain\"></div>\n<div id=\"loading\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">KESTREL DEFENCE / FLIGHT SYSTEMS</div><strong>STAR RECLAIMERS</strong><div id=\"loading-bar\"><i></i></div><p id=\"load-status\">Starting the reactor. Preparing WebGPU and the flight computer…</p></div>\n<div id=\"title-screen\" class=\"hide\">\n<div class=\"topline\"><div class=\"brand-mark\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 2 37 31H3Z\" stroke=\"#f5f0d7\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"m20 9 6 17-6-4-6 4Z\" fill=\"#ffdf78\"/><path d=\"M1 36h38\" stroke=\"#8bdaca\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>KESTREL / DEEP SPACE DIVISION</div><div class=\"edition\">FIELD MANUAL 082 &nbsp; / &nbsp; NOVEMBER 1982</div></div>\n<div class=\"title-body\"><span class=\"pill\"><i></i> SINGLE OPERATION · SIX SECTORS</span><h1>STAR<span>RECLAIMERS</span></h1><div class=\"title-kicker\">THE VOID DOESN’T PATROL ITSELF.</div><p class=\"intro-copy\">One ship. A very large sky. Keep the starbase standing, break the blockade, and bring yourself home.</p><div class=\"title-buttons\"><button class=\"menu-primary\" data-cmd=\"launch\"><span><span data-glyph=\"accept\"></span>Launch patrol</span><span class=\"right-arrow\">↗</span></button><button class=\"menu-secondary\" data-cmd=\"help\"><span>Flight briefing</span><span class=\"sub\">LEARN THE SHIP</span></button><button class=\"menu-secondary\" data-cmd=\"network\"><span>Wingmate link</span><span class=\"sub\">TWO-PILOT RACE</span></button></div></div>\n<div class=\"coordinate mono\">SECTOR 01 / KESTREL<br>RAIDER CONTACTS: 03<br><span style=\"color:var(--yellow)\">YOUR WATCH STARTS HERE.</span></div><div class=\"title-side\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">PATROL ORDER / 01</div><div class=\"side-number\">HOLD THE LINE.</div><p>Enemy transmissions detected beyond the Ember Belt. Your starbase has requested a volunteer.</p><div class=\"tiny mono\">THEY HAVE ALREADY VOLUNTEERED YOU.</div></div>\n<div class=\"title-foot\"><div class=\"link-group\"><button class=\"text-button\" data-cmd=\"settings\">Settings</button><span>/</span><button class=\"text-button\" data-cmd=\"about\">About & credits</button></div><span class=\"mono\" id=\"title-input\">MOUSE + KEYBOARD / CONTROLLER READY</span><span class=\"mono\" id=\"best-score\">PERSONAL BEST —</span></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"hud\" class=\"hide\"><canvas id=\"hud-canvas\"></canvas><div class=\"screen-frame\"></div><div class=\"hud-top\"><div class=\"sector-block\"><div class=\"hud-label\">KESTREL DEFENCE / PATROL 082</div><h2 id=\"sector-name\">01 / KESTREL</h2><small id=\"sector-type\">STARBASE PERIMETER</small></div><div class=\"heading-tape mono\" id=\"heading-tape\">PORT &nbsp; · &nbsp; 000 &nbsp; · &nbsp; STARBOARD</div><div class=\"score-block\"><small>PATROL SCORE</small><strong id=\"hud-score\">00000</strong><small id=\"contacts\">3 HOSTILE CONTACTS</small></div></div><div class=\"objective\"><small id=\"objective-label\">PATROL ORDER</small><b id=\"objective-text\"></b></div><div class=\"comms hide\" id=\"comms\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">▰ ▱ ▰ &nbsp; OPS / MICA</div><p id=\"comms-text\"></p></div><div id=\"reticle\"><i></i></div><div class=\"cockpit-data\"><div class=\"radar-wrap\"><div><div class=\"radar\" id=\"radar\"><div class=\"radar-ring\"></div><div id=\"blips\"></div></div><div class=\"radar-label\">LONG-RANGE SCAN / 1200</div></div><div class=\"speed-display\"><strong id=\"speed\">00</strong><span>METRES / SEC</span><span id=\"throttle\">THRUST 25%</span></div></div><div class=\"gauges\"><div class=\"gauge hull\"><div class=\"stat-label\">HULL <span>HP</span></div><strong id=\"hull-value\">100</strong><div class=\"meter\"><i id=\"hull-meter\"></i></div></div><div class=\"gauge\"><div class=\"stat-label\">SHIELD <span id=\"shield-state\">ON</span></div><strong id=\"shield-value\">100</strong><div class=\"meter\"><i id=\"shield-meter\"></i></div></div><div class=\"gauge energy\"><div class=\"stat-label\">ENERGY <span>EU</span></div><strong id=\"energy-value\">100</strong><div class=\"meter\"><i id=\"energy-meter\"></i></div></div></div><div class=\"target-readout\"><small id=\"target-category\">TARGET COMPUTER</small><strong id=\"target-name\">SEARCHING…</strong><div class=\"target-detail\"><span id=\"target-range\">NO LOCK</span><span id=\"target-hp\">T TO CYCLE</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i id=\"target-meter\"></i></div></div></div><button id=\"context-action\" class=\"context-action hide\" data-cmd=\"interact\"></button><div class=\"actions\" id=\"action-prompts\"></div><div id=\"wingmate-hud\" class=\"wingmate hide\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"damage-flash\" id=\"damage-flash\"></div><div class=\"jump-overlay\" id=\"jump-overlay\"></div><div class=\"jump-text hide\" id=\"jump-text\"><small>HYPERSPACE DRIVE / VECTOR ACQUIRED</small><strong id=\"jump-name\">EMBER BELT</strong><small id=\"jump-count\">SPOOLING</small></div><div class=\"attract-banner hide\" id=\"attract-banner\"><strong>AUTOPILOT EXHIBITION</strong><small>ANY INPUT TO TAKE THE WATCH</small></div><button class=\"touch-menu hide\" id=\"touch-menu\" data-cmd=\"pause\" aria-label=\"Pause\">Ⅱ</button><button class=\"touch-action hide\" id=\"touch-chart\" data-cmd=\"chart\">Sector chart</button><button class=\"touch-action hide\" id=\"touch-nova\" data-cmd=\"nova\">Nova × 3</button><div class=\"touch-hint hide\" id=\"touch-hint\"><span>THRUST / STRAFE</span><span>STEER / AUTO FIRE</span></div>\n<div id=\"modal\" class=\"hide\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Game menu\"></div><div id=\"notice\" class=\"notice hide\" role=\"status\"></div>\n<script>{{GAME_BUNDLE}}</script>\n</body></html>\nEOF\ncat > build.mjs <<'\"'EOF'\nimport {build} from 'esbuild';\nimport fs from 'node:fs/promises';\nimport path from 'node:path';\nconst root=path.basename(process.cwd());\nconst output=await build({entryPoints:['main.js'],bundle:true,write:false,format:'iife',target:'es2022',minify:true,legalComments:'inline',logLevel:'silent'});\nconst template=await fs.readFile('shell.html','utf8');\nconst hub=await fs.readFile('hub-session.js','utf8');\nconst js=output.outputFiles[0].text.replaceAll('</script','<\\\\\\\\/script');\nconst html=template.replace('{{HUB_CLIENT}}',()=>hub).replace('{{GAME_BUNDLE}}',()=>js);\nawait fs.writeFile('../'+root+'.html',html);\nawait fs.copyFile('hub-bridge.js','bridge.js');\nawait fs.copyFile('hub-round.js','round.js');\nconsole.log('Built '+root+'.html ('+(html.length/1048576).toFixed(2)+' MiB)');\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > shell.html <<'EOF'\n<\"'!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<script>{{HUB_CLIENT}}</script>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#111525\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"ghost\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Save Kestrel, destroy the Crown, return with the best score\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Sticks fly; R2 fire; L1 chart; R1 jump. Mouse aim, WASD fly, M chart, J jump.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"12\">\n<title>Star Reclaimers — a deep-space patrol</title>\n<style>\n@font-face{font-family:Display;src:local('\"'Impact')}*{box-sizing:border-box} :root{--ink:#101421;--paper:#f5f0d7;--muted:#a7b4be;--yellow:#ffdf78;--cyan:#8bdaca;--red:#f08068;--panel:rgba(16,23,37,.92)}html,body{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(14px,1.28vw,25px)}button,input,textarea{font:inherit}button{color:inherit;cursor:pointer;touch-action:manipulation}button:disabled{opacity:.38;cursor:default}button,textarea,input{outline:none}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,.focused{outline:3px solid var(--yellow)\"'!important;outline-offset:5px!important}button:hover{filter:brightness(1.13)}button:active{transform:translateY(2px)}button{transition:background .15s,transform .15s}canvas#world{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}#ink-wash{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 35%,transparent 25%,rgba(9,15,27,.28) 75%),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(14,18,31,.5),transparent 65%);mix-blend-mode:multiply}#grain{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.075;background-image:url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='\"'0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.68' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Cpath fill='%23fff' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='.7' d='M0 0h180v180H0z'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\\\")} .hide{display:none\"'!important}.mono,.eyebrow,.pill,.glyph,.stat-label,.map-meta,.hud-label{font-family:'\"'Courier New',monospace;font-weight:700}.eyebrow{font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cyan)}.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.55em;border:1px solid #75818d;border-radius:2px;padding:.45em .8em;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.12em}.pill i{width:.5em;height:.5em;background:var(--cyan);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--cyan)}#title-screen{position:fixed;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:3.2vh 4.2vw 2.8vh} .topline{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand-mark{display:flex;gap:.7em;align-items:center;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em}.brand-mark svg{width:2.6em;height:2.6em}.edition{color:var(--muted);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.13em}.title-body{margin-top:-1vh;width:52%;max-width:1000px}.title-body h1{font-family:Display,'Arial Black',Arial,sans-serif;font-stretch:condensed;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(66px,9.5vw,185px);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.028em;margin:3vh 0 2vh;text-transform:uppercase;text-shadow:5px 5px 0 #0c1524;transform:skewY(-3deg);transform-origin:left}.title-body h1 span{display:block;color:var(--yellow);font-size:.88em}.title-kicker{font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:.07em;margin:3.2vh 0 2vh;color:var(--paper)}.intro-copy{max-width:25em;font-size:.85rem;color:#c0c9cb;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:3vh}.title-buttons{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.4vh;width:22em;max-width:94%}.menu-primary,.menu-secondary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:.85em 1em;border:2px solid var(--paper);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.025em;min-height:3.2em;text-align:left}.menu-primary{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--yellow);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--ink)}.menu-primary .sub{font-size:.64em;font-weight:600;opacity:.75}.menu-secondary{background:rgba(17,24,40,.65);border-color:#677582}.menu-secondary .sub{font-size:.6em;color:var(--muted)}.title-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.66rem;color:var(--muted)}.link-group{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.2em}.text-button{background:none;border:0;padding:.5em 0;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--paper)}.title-side{position:absolute;right:4.2vw;bottom:17vh;max-width:21em;border-left:2px solid var(--yellow);padding-left:1em}.title-side p{font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.5;color:#c1cbd0}.side-number{font-family:Display,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:2.4rem;letter-spacing:.06em}.coordinate{position:absolute;right:4.2vw;top:20vh;text-align:right;font-size:.65rem;color:var(--cyan);line-height:1.8}.tiny{font-size:.6rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}.glyph{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-width:1.6em;height:1.6em;padding:0 .25em;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:3px;font-size:.74em;margin-right:.4em;line-height:1}.glyph.circle{border-radius:50%}.right-arrow{font-size:1.4em}.tag{color:var(--cyan)}#loading{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#111827;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:20;gap:1.5rem}#loading strong{font-family:Display,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:3rem;letter-spacing:.08em}#loading-bar{width:18em;height:4px;background:#35414f;overflow:hidden}#loading-bar i{display:block;width:20%;height:100%;background:var(--yellow);animation:load 1.3s ease-in-out infinite}@keyframes load{50%{transform:translateX(400%)}}#loading p{font-size:.75rem;c