{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"agent_message","text":"The first browser run reaches the title screen and flies correctly; the WebGL compatibility view also shows the cockpit and cel-shaded scene. The headless WebGPU run produced a blank canvas and a device-loss message, so I’m investigating that separately.\n\nThe first pass also caught a few material setup warnings and mislabeled developer-slider units. Those are corrected, and I’m now running a simulated playthrough.\n"}}
